== 2026-10-22 - Patch Notes - Nektropos Castle ==
These patch notes are from the Official EverQuest Legends discord, posted on October 22, 2026

=== NEKTROPOS RELEASE === 

[https://www.everquestlegends.com/news/eql-nektropos-castle The Secrets Behind Nektropos Castle's Doors Await You]

=== General === 
* [[Vlad Sterovich]] at the [[Lake Nerius]] Trading Center needs a few ingredients for a 'healing potion'. His idea of healing, of course, is soothing the soul with the macabre.
* The [[Petamorph Wand: Werewolf]] item is available for FREE through the in-game Marketplace for a limited time.

=== AA === 
* Rank 2 of Rampage is now available at level 40 for [[Warrior|Warriors]] and [[Berserker|Berserkers]].

=== Gameplay === 
* Increased the base damage of Frenzy based on the primary weapon ratio.
* NPCs (including pets) that can backstab are now also able to [[kick]] and [[bash]].

=== Spells & Pets === 
* Pet commands like Attack, Back off, etc. will put a temporary hold on the pet, preventing it from reacting to other hostile actions for 6 seconds.
* Turning on pet taunt will now increase the pet's threat generation by 75%.
* Turning off pet taunt will now decrease the pet's threat generation by 50%.
* NPCs who were immune to pet taunt will no longer have this immunity in public zones or solo instances.
* The taunt toggle is now enabled for use with charmed pets, however it will only provide the increase or decrease in aggro generation, and not enable the taunt action.
* Fixed an issue with damage bonus when pets equipped a weapon with exactly 28 delay.
* Fixed pet weapon choice preferences to better follow the new pet weapon bonus system.
* Fixed an issue where several pet toggles (like Pet Taunt) would not retain its previous state on spawn.
* Pets summoned via [[Monster Summoning I|Monster Summoning]] will now be [[Warrior]]/[[Berserker]].
* Summoned pets will now gain additional mana from [[Wisdom]] and [[Intelligence]].
* Summoned pet HP calculations now include a [[stamina]] dependence.

=== Stances & Invocations === 
* Berserker Stance has had its swing speed modifier increased slightly, its self-damage removed, and its bonuses to avoidance and mitigation removed.
* Stances that reduce spell damage will now include damage over time effects.

=== UI === 
* Spell window and tooltip descriptions have been adjusted to provide more specific and accurate information about their various effects. More effects will be implemented over time.
* Fixed a typo on [[Slugs Healing]] 'Cast on you' message.
* Fixed a client hang in specific scenarios related to the UI.

== 2026-10-13 - Patch Notes ==
These patch notes are from the Official EverQuest Legends discord, posted on October 13, 2026

=== General ===
* Fixed an issue where attempting to save [[Barbarian]] face customizations would fail.

=== Raid Resuming ===
* Each boss in a raid with a lockout timer is now a checkpoint and once killed. Any spawn point tied to this boss's timer will not spawn when you resume the raid. While this is not particularly useful in today's content, this will be useful in later content.
* The replay timer requirement for joining a group member's raid has also been removed. However, you will not receive loot from bosses if you have already killed that boss today.
** NOTE: If a player joins another player's resumed raid and has a boss you shouldn't get loot on yet due to lockouts you will be able to kill the boss but will receive no loot for that boss. 
** You will receive the same total possible loot per day/week as before, but there are now more options to assist your friends.

=== [[Alternate Advancement|AAs]] ===
* Widened Perceptions now works correctly after you switch to a low-level loadout.
* Unbound Cascade now adds to your base critical damage. Before this fix, it actually lowered your crit damage.

=== Pets ===
* Pets with equipped items now use new and improved damage and delay calculations. When picking a pet weapon, its ratio now matters much more than its base damage.
* Player pet damage no longer applies weapon damage bonus to items that no longer exist.
* Increased the level cap for upgraded player pets from player level - 1 to player level.

=== [[Achievements]] ===
* The Kobold-slaying achievement now names the continent of Odus instead of Gloomingdeep.

=== Spells ===
* Magical Monologue no longer appears in the [[Bard]] song list.

