=== Gameplay === 
* Player pets now respect lore equipped restrictions when transferring items from the player pet inventory.
* Fixed an issue where group members while charmed or feared may not receive loot.

=== UI === 
* Spell upgrade suffixes will now also appear correctly in chat for status updates such as interrupts, fizzles, missed notes, wore-off, and damage.
* The Magician AA Ability Turn Summoned should no longer show unobtainable ranks.
* Maps have been added for the [[Plane of Hate]], [[The Hole]], [[Rathe Mountains]], and [[Runnyeye]].

== 2026-09-09 - Patch Notes ==
These patch notes are from the Official EverQuest Legends discord, posted on September 9, 2026

=== [[Dungeon Crawl|Dungeon Crawls]] ===
* Non-Respawning Zones are now known as [[Dungeon Crawl|Dungeon Crawls]]!
* [[Dungeon Crawl|Dungeon Crawls]] are active in indoor Dungeons. They function similarly to the old Non-Respawning Zones, but with special rewards for clearing the Dungeon Crawl.
** To finish, slay every rare creature and enough of the zone's original population. Nothing you kill will respawn naturally.
** You'll earn motes and experience upon completion, and anything you killed may add its loot and coin to the Bonus Chest on completion.
** The easier the zone is for you, the smaller the payout.
** Finish the Dungeon Crawl, and you get your instance charge back.
** Rare creatures will appear on your map while in a Dungeon Crawl.

=== AAs === 
* Spell Casting Subtlety, Symphonic Aura, and Reaching Notes are now toggleable without the rank of the AA changing.
* The 'Disabled' Ranks of AAs have been removed, and 'Enabled' removed from the names of the AAs.
** There should be no change in the amount of AAs spent or assigned.
** When these AAs are purchased, and a hotkey is created, the player may press the hotkey to enable the AA, which will be indicated by a green ring around the hotkey. Pressing the button again will disable the ability.
* Fixed a bug where Blood Rune's cap was 5/8/10 instead of 5%/8%/10% of player's maximum HP.
* Symphonic Aura now suppresses spell instrument animations and sounds.
** NOTE: Spell particle effects remain controlled by the existing Beneficial Songs option.

=== Achievements === 
* The "You're Faunny!" and "It's Plane to See" achievements should now be properly labeled as optional.

=== Gameplay === 
* Fixed the running animation acting strange when using instruments or attacking.
* Bosses in the [[Plane of Sky]] are now all flagged as rare creatures.
* Fixed an issue that made pets not able to proc AOE spells.
* The [[levitation]] fall rate has been normalized for smoother falling experiences.

=== Items === 
* [[Spider Silk Cap]] can now once again be upgraded.

=== Spells ===
* Further prevented detrimental spells from stripping beneficial spells when their effects collide.

=== UI ===
* Fixed an erroneous string when attempting to leave an instance while in combat.
* Added a message about the failure to earn an instance recharge if a dungeon crawl is too easy.
* The non-existent zone line from [[Mistmoore Castle]] to The Bloodfalls no longer appears in the Find window.

