=== [[Spell Upgrade System]] Implementation === 
* Players can now upgrade spells using motes. Upgrading spells can be done through inspecting spells (via right-click hold) and adding motes, similar to [[Item Upgrade System|upgrading items with motes]].
* Upgraded spells currently gain the following benefits, with more added later.:
** Reduced mana cost.
** Reduced cast, recovery and re-use time.
** Increased durations.
** Increased potential for the spells to not be resisted.
* Dev Note: The spell upgrade system is a work in progress and we expect the second part of spell upgrades to hit during the first week of Preorder Beta. However, we wanted to give players the ability to upgrade their spells now, so that a new jarring system is not introduced mid-Preorder Beta. This will include values including, but not limited to, Hitpoints, Damage, etc, which were not completed for this patch cycle. We look forward to introducing more of this system soon.

