== 2026-06-23 - Patch Notes ==
These patch notes are from the Official EverQuest Legends discord, posted on June 23, 2026

=== General ===
* [[Zone Experience Modifier]] Changes
** Most cities now reward normal experience for those who don't mind ruining someone else's lands to level.
** Most open world zones have had their [[ZEMs|ZEM]] increased and many dungeons have been slightly decreased to provide more viable leveling paths.
** [[Kedge Keep|Kedge]] has retained its original modifier for those willing to brave the depths.
