* The hastily built barricades in [[New Sebilis Expedition|New Sebilis]] have started to rattle...
** The hemmed-in monstrosities are becoming restless, and are nearly ready to take the fight beyond the defenses laid by the Expedition.
** But for now, the barricades hold...

=== AAs ===
* The [[Warrior|Warrior's]] Endurance AA has been re-enabled.
* The Escape AA for [[Rogue|Rogues]] has been fixed to not be autogranted.

