* [[Rogue|Rogues]] now gain two new [[disciplines]] at level 46.
** Cobra Venom, which is an upgraded replacement for Asp Venom.
** Blood Draw Venom, which is an upgraded replacement for Blood Siphon Venom.
 
=== Gameplay ===
* A mysterious presence has been spotted lingering near one of the voidlings. Brave adventurers should probably investigate.
