*  Fixed error message wording for zooming in and out while in find mode on the map.
*  Fixed an issue where your spell bar columns/rows weren't loaded properly making your spellbar change shape and size on each relog/UI reload.
*  Fixed an issue with loading screen tips where several tips were merged together.

=== Dungeon Revamp! ===
*  [[Blackburrow]] has been revamped!
**  Zone population has been adjusted to provide a smoother leveling experience for characters levels 5-20. Some familiar loot has been upgraded for the EverQuest Legends era, and some spicy new loot has been added.

